  "releaseNotes": "Server message pass-through: validation, session, and meter consume/balance APIs now surface the server's user-facing message instead of generic client text. Session forbidden responses use server text for blocked/mismatch cases. Metered (Credit-Based / Usage-Based): ConsumeAsync and GetBalanceAsync via MeterManager. Previous (1.8.2): stable hardware fingerprint persisted across reboots and network changes.",
